---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Private Health Insurance Germany"
  description="Private Health Insurance Germany is an independent English-language guide to private health insurance in Germany for expats and foreign nationals. Meet the team."
>
  <main>
    <section class="hero-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="breadcrumb">
          <a href="/">Home</a>
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/></svg>
          <span>About</span>
        </div>
        <h1>About Private Health Insurance Germany</h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">An independent guide built by expats, for expats — to make Germany's private health insurance system actually understandable.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section">
      <div class="container content-grid">

        <article class="main-content">
          <div class="mission-block">
            <h2>Why we built this</h2>
            <p>Germany has one of the most complex health insurance systems in the world. When you arrive as an expat, you're immediately asked to choose between public insurance and private insurance — often without knowing what the difference is, which you're eligible for, or what the long-term consequences are.</p>
            <p>We built Private Health Insurance Germany to fix that. Plain English. No jargon. No upselling. Just clear information to help you make a confident, informed decision.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="about-block">
            <h2>Who we are</h2>
            <p>Private Health Insurance Germany is run by a small team with firsthand experience navigating German bureaucracy as non-native speakers. We work closely with licensed §34d insurance brokers who handle the actual advice and product recommendations.</p>
            <p>We are not an insurance company, and we do not sell policies directly. Our role is to explain the system and connect you with qualified professionals who do.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="author-block">
            <div class="author-card">
              <div class="author-avatar">
                <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div class="author-info">
                <h3>Marco Maurelli</h3>
                <span class="author-role">Founder, Private Health Insurance Germany</span>
                <p>Originally from Rome, Marco moved to Berlin at 18 and has spent years helping expats understand German insurance, banking, and bureaucracy. He writes and edits content on this site and works with licensed §34d brokers to connect readers with qualified advice.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="model-block">
            <h2>How we make money</h2>
            <p>When we connect you with a licensed broker and you take out a private health insurance policy through them, the insurer pays the broker a commission. This is standard practice in the German insurance industry and does not affect your premium in any way.</p>
            <p>Our advice and content are always independent. We will never recommend a product because it pays us more.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="broker-block">
            <h2>Our broker partner</h2>
            <p>We work with <strong>MyHealthcareBroker</strong>, a licensed German insurance brokerage under §34d GewO specializing in expats and international professionals. All their advisors speak English and are registered with the relevant supervisory authorities.</p>
            <a href="/contact" class="cta-link">
              Book a free consultation
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <aside class="side-panel">
          <div class="quick-facts">
            <h3>Quick facts</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>
                <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
                Independent — not affiliated with any insurer
              </li>
              <li>
                <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
                Content reviewed by §34d licensed brokers
              </li>
              <li>
                <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
                Written in plain English for expats
              </li>
              <li>
                <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
                Free consultation, no hidden fees
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="contact-card">
            <h3>Get in touch</h3>
            <p>Questions about the site, content corrections, or partnership inquiries:</p>
            <a href="mailto:contact@private-health-insurance-germany.com" class="email-link" style="white-space:nowrap">contact@private-health-insurance-germany.com</a>
          </div>

          <div class="disclaimer-card">
            <p>Private Health Insurance Germany is an informational guide. We are not a licensed insurance broker. Always consult a qualified §34d broker before making insurance decisions.</p>
          </div>
        </aside>

      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Person",
  "name": "Marco Maurelli",
  "jobTitle": "Founder",
  "worksFor": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "Private Health Insurance Germany",
    "url": "https://private-health-insurance-germany.com"
  },
  "url": "https://private-health-insurance-germany.com/about",
  "description": "Expat based in Berlin, founder of Private Health Insurance Germany. Helps international professionals understand private health insurance in Germany.",
  "knowsAbout": ["Private health insurance Germany", "private health insurance", "public health insurance", "Expat health insurance Germany"]
}
</script>

<style>
  main { background: var(--bg); }

  .hero-section {
    background: #fff;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem) clamp(1rem, 4vw, 2rem);
  }
  .container { max-width: 1140px; margin: 0 auto; }

  .breadcrumb {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .4rem;
    font-size: .82rem; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .breadcrumb a { color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; }
  .breadcrumb a:hover { color: var(--red); }
  .breadcrumb svg { color: var(--muted); }

  .hero-section h1 { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.4rem); font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: .75rem; }
  .hero-sub { font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--muted); max-width: 580px; line-height: 1.65; }

  .content-section { padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem) clamp(1rem, 4vw, 2rem); }
  .content-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 300px; gap: 2.5rem; align-items: start; }

  .main-content { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2.5rem; }

  .mission-block, .about-block, .model-block, .broker-block {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
  }
  .mission-block h2, .about-block h2, .model-block h2, .broker-block h2 {
    font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: .85rem;
  }
  .mission-block p, .about-block p, .model-block p, .broker-block p {
    color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.7; font-size: .95rem; margin-bottom: .75rem;
  }
  .mission-block p:last-child, .about-block p:last-child, .model-block p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

  .cta-link {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .4rem;
    color: var(--red); font-weight: 700; font-size: .9rem;
    text-decoration: none; margin-top: .5rem;
    transition: gap var(--ease);
  }
  .cta-link:hover { gap: .7rem; }

  .author-block {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
  }
  .author-card { display: flex; gap: 1.25rem; align-items: flex-start; }
  .author-avatar {
    width: 60px; height: 60px; flex-shrink: 0;
    background: var(--red); border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  }
  .author-info h3 { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: .2rem; }
  .author-role {
    font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .05em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--red); display: block; margin-bottom: .6rem;
  }
  .author-info p { font-size: .88rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.65; margin: 0; }

  /* Side panel */
  .side-panel { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.25rem; }

  .quick-facts, .contact-card, .disclaimer-card {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }
  .quick-facts h3, .contact-card h3 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .quick-facts ul { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .6rem; }
  .quick-facts li { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: .5rem; font-size: .88rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.4; }
  .quick-facts svg { color: #059669; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: .15rem; }

  .contact-card p { font-size: .85rem; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: .6rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  .email-link { font-size: .82rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--red); text-decoration: none; }

  .disclaimer-card { background: #fafafa; border-style: dashed; }
  .disclaimer-card p { font-size: .8rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.55; margin: 0; }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .content-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .side-panel { order: -1; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 500px) {
    .author-card { flex-direction: column; }
  }
</style>
